    "description": {
      "value": "You throw a handful of sand that transforms into jagged shards of glass. Creatures in the area take 4d6 slashing damage and must attempt a Reflex save.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The target is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The target takes half damage\n- **Failure:** The target takes full damage and 1 persistent bleed damage.\n- **Critical Failure:** The target takes double damage and 2 persistent bleed damage."
    },
    "higher_level_description": {
      "value": "Heightened (+1): The damage increases by 2d6."
